{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-model-portability","title":"成本与模型可移植性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-optimization-dspy/practice/cost-model-portability","wordCount":1654,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"成本与模型可移植性\">成本与模型可移植性</h1><p>程序化优化不是白来的：优化器要烧一大把 token 去搜，编译出的提示部署后每次推理又有成本。要不要上 DSPy，很多时候是一笔经济账。同时 DSPy 有一个被严重低估的卖点——换模型只需改一行再重编译，提示自动适配。这一篇把优化成本、推理成本两笔账算清楚，再讲可移植性这个独特价值，让你能给「值不值得编译」做出量化判断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>要不要上 DSPy，很多时候是一笔经济账，而它由<strong>两笔成本</strong>和<strong>一个独特价值</strong>构成。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>优化成本（一次性）</strong>：优化器反复跑数据评估候选配置，量级约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>trials</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>val</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{trials}} \\times |D_{\\text{val}}| \\times c_{\\text{stage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trials</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">val</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>推理成本（随调用量累积）</strong>：来自提示里塞进的少样本示例与模块策略，长期看常是大头。</li>\n<li><strong>可移植性（独特价值）</strong>：换模型只改一行 <code>dspy.LM</code> 再重编译，提示自动适配，省去手工重调的人力。</li>\n</ul>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化器</th>\n<th>优化成本量级</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>LabeledFewShot</code></td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>快速基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BootstrapFewShot</code></td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小数据起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MIPROv2</code></td>\n<td>中–高</td>\n<td>数据足、求稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GEPA</code></td>\n<td>中（样本效率高）</td>\n<td>数据少、省 rollout</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>判据：高频、长期、质量敏感的系统编译几乎总划算；一次性原型用便宜优化器。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优化成本-一次性的搜索开销\">优化成本：一次性的搜索开销</h2><p>编译要花钱，因为优化器反复跑数据评估候选配置。粗略地，优化阶段的总调用次数约为</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>opt</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>trials</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>val</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{opt}} \\approx N_{\\text{trials}} \\times |D_{\\text{val}}| \\times c_{\\text{stage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">opt</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trials</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">val</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>trials</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{trials}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trials</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是搜索轮数，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>val</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|D_{\\text{val}}|</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">val</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span></span></span></span></span> 是验证集大小，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{stage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是流水线里语言模型调用节点数。这解释了为什么不同优化器的成本差异巨大：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>优化器</th>\n<th>典型轮数/评估量</th>\n<th>优化成本量级</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>LabeledFewShot</code></td>\n<td>近乎 0 搜索</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>快速基线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>BootstrapFewShot</code></td>\n<td>跑一遍训练集</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>小数据起步</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>MIPROv2</code></td>\n<td>200+ 样本、40+ 轮</td>\n<td>中–高</td>\n<td>数据足、求稳</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>GEPA</code></td>\n<td>可低至 ~10 样本、少量评估</td>\n<td>中（样本效率高）</td>\n<td>数据少、省 rollout</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><a href=\"../optimizers/instruction-optimization-mipro\">GEPA</a> 的样本效率是它的经济亮点：论文报告它相比强化学习方法 GRPO（约 24k 次 rollout）最多能省 35 倍 rollout 取得更优结果（来源：arxiv:2507.19457）。降低优化成本的实操手段：先用 <code>BootstrapFewShot</code> 拿便宜基线，确认 DSPy 这条路有效再上 MIPRO/GEPA；优化时用便宜模型当被优化对象，必要时配强模型当 teacher；缩小 valset 到「够区分配置」的最小规模。</p>\n<h2 id=\"推理成本-编译产物的长期开销\">推理成本：编译产物的长期开销</h2><p>优化是一次性的，推理成本却随调用量线性累积，长期看往往是大头。编译产物的推理成本来自两块：提示里塞进的少样本示例（吃输入 token），以及模块策略本身（<code>ChainOfThought</code> 比 <code>Predict</code> 多生成推理 token）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  Opt[优化成本&lt;br/&gt;一次性] --&gt; Dec{部署决策}&#10;  Inf[推理成本&lt;br/&gt;随调用量累积] --&gt; Dec&#10;  Dec --&gt; A[高频部署&lt;br/&gt;推理成本主导]&#10;  Dec --&gt; B[低频/一次性&lt;br/&gt;优化成本主导]&#10;  A --&gt; Opt2[值得多花优化&lt;br/&gt;换更短提示降推理]&#10;  B --&gt; Opt3[少优化&lt;br/&gt;用便宜优化器]\">flowchart TD\n  Opt[优化成本&lt;br/&gt;一次性] --&gt; Dec{部署决策}\n  Inf[推理成本&lt;br/&gt;随调用量累积] --&gt; Dec\n  Dec --&gt; A[高频部署&lt;br/&gt;推理成本主导]\n  Dec --&gt; B[低频/一次性&lt;br/&gt;优化成本主导]\n  A --&gt; Opt2[值得多花优化&lt;br/&gt;换更短提示降推理]\n  B --&gt; Opt3[少优化&lt;br/&gt;用便宜优化器]</pre><p>这里 GEPA 又有结构性优势：它常产出<strong>更短</strong>的指令、甚至不依赖少样本示例，直接压低每次推理的输入 token。在高频部署下，「优化时多花一点换一个更短的提示」往往几天就回本。要权衡示例数量与质量时，可回看 <a href=\"../optimizers/bootstrap-few-shot\">自举少样本</a> 的 <code>max_bootstrapped_demos</code> 旋钮——更多示例通常更准但更贵。运行时若叠了 <a href=\"../pipelines/assertions-constraints\">断言与约束</a> 的 <code>Refine</code>，还要把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 倍重试摊进推理成本。token 计费、上下文窗口、缓存这些底层经济学的系统讲解在 <a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/token-economics\">38 成本与延迟优化·token 经济学</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可移植性-换模型只改一行\">可移植性：换模型只改一行</h2><p>DSPy 最反直觉的卖点是这个：因为你写的是<strong>声明式程序</strong>而非具体提示文字，换语言模型只需改一行配置，再重新编译一次，提示会自动适配新模型。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import dspy&#10;dspy.configure(lm=dspy.LM(&quot;openai/gpt-4o-mini&quot;))   # 换成另一个模型只改这里&#10;compiled = optimizer.compile(program, trainset=trainset, valset=valset)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dspy</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dspy.configure(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">lm</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">dspy.LM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"openai/gpt-4o-mini\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">))   </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 换成另一个模型只改这里</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">compiled </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> optimizer.compile(program, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">trainset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">trainset, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">valset</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">valset)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>对比手工提示流水线：换模型意味着所有精心调过的措辞可能全部失效，要从头重调——因为提示是为旧模型的脾性量身定的。DSPy 把「为这个模型该怎么写提示」这件事交给优化器，于是模型成了可替换的后端。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>手工提示流水线</th>\n<th>DSPy 程序</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>换底层模型</td>\n<td>大量提示需重写重调</td>\n<td>改一行 <code>dspy.LM</code> + 重编译</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适配新模型脾性</td>\n<td>人工试错</td>\n<td>优化器自动重搜</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>一套程序多模型部署</td>\n<td>维护多套提示</td>\n<td>一份程序，按模型各编译一份</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这带来一个实际策略：开发期用便宜模型快速迭代程序结构，定稿后针对生产模型重编译一次拿到最优提示。模型层级与级联路由（贵模型兜底、便宜模型主力）的工程化在 <a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/model-routing/cascade-routing\">38 成本与延迟优化·级联路由</a>；DSPy 的贡献是让「换层」时提示不必手工重适配。</p>\n<h2 id=\"一笔总账-什么时候编译划算\">一笔总账：什么时候编译划算</h2><p>把两笔账合起来，判据是「优化的一次性投入能否被推理期的质量/成本收益摊销回来」。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>高频、长期、质量敏感</strong>的系统：编译几乎总划算——一次性优化换持续的质量提升与（GEPA 更短提示带来的）推理省钱。</li>\n<li><strong>一次性、低频、原型阶段</strong>：用便宜优化器或干脆 <code>LabeledFewShot</code>，别上重型搜索。</li>\n<li><strong>频繁换模型</strong>的场景：DSPy 的可移植性单独就值回票价——省下的每次「换模型重调提示」的人力，比优化的 token 成本大得多。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>这套权衡和评估闭环是连着的：你得先有 <a href=\"evaluation-iteration\">评估与迭代</a> 的可信分数，才能判断「多花的优化成本」是否换来了「真实的质量提升」。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>优化成本是一次性搜索开销，量级随 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>trials</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>D</mi><mtext>val</mtext></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>stage</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N_{\\text{trials}} \\times |D_{\\text{val}}| \\times c_{\\text{stage}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">trials</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">D</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">val</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">stage</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 变化；GEPA 样本效率高（比 GRPO 省最多 35× rollout）。</li>\n<li>推理成本随调用量累积，长期常是大头，来自示例 token 与模块策略；GEPA 的更短提示直接压低它。</li>\n<li>可移植性是 DSPy 独特卖点：换模型只改一行 <code>dspy.LM</code> 再重编译，提示自动适配，省去手工重调。</li>\n<li>划算判据：高频长期质量敏感的系统编译几乎总值；一次性原型用便宜优化器；频繁换模型时可移植性单独回本。</li>\n<li>成本判断依赖可信评估分数，与评估闭环连体使用。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"evaluation-iteration\">评估与迭代</a> — 可信分数是判断成本收益的前提。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../optimizers/instruction-optimization-mipro\">指令优化 MIPRO</a> — GEPA 的样本效率与更短提示。</li>\n<li>本 hub 兄弟篇：<a href=\"../pipelines/assertions-constraints\">断言与约束</a> — <code>Refine</code> 重试摊进推理成本。</li>\n<li>跨 hub：<a href=\"../../ai-cost-latency-optimization/cost-latency-model/token-economics\">38 成本与延迟优化·token 经济学</a> — token 计费与上下文经济学底层。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"成本与模型可移植性","id":"成本与模型可移植性"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"优化成本：一次性的搜索开销","id":"优化成本-一次性的搜索开销"},{"level":2,"text":"推理成本：编译产物的长期开销","id":"推理成本-编译产物的长期开销"},{"level":2,"text":"可移植性：换模型只改一行","id":"可移植性-换模型只改一行"},{"level":2,"text":"一笔总账：什么时候编译划算","id":"一笔总账-什么时候编译划算"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"评估与迭代","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-optimization-dspy/practice/evaluation-iteration"},"next":{"title":"生态与前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/prompt-optimization-dspy/practice/dspy-ecosystem-frontier"}}